{"id":728,"title":{"romaji":"Eyeshield 21","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"eyeshield_21","synopsis":"Welcome To the Gridiron of the Damned!   Huge hulking bodies throw themselves at each other, while a tiny lithe body runs between them for the goal!  No, it&rsquo;s not a game of football, it&rsquo;s Sena Kobayakawa trying to evade the monstrous Ha-Ha brothers down the halls of Deimon High School!  But wait!  Sena&rsquo;s incredible skills at not getting caught have been spotted by the devilish (possibly actually demonic) captain of the school&rsquo;s embryonic American style football team, and when Sena asks to be the teams manager, he gets  thrust onto the field as a running back instead!  But there are two BIG catches: first, to keep the identity of their new &ldquo;star&rdquo; player an absolute secret, Yoichi makes Sena wear an opaque visor on his helmet and gives him the alias of &ldquo;Eyeshield 21.&rdquo;  And the second catch?  Well, in order to hit his fastest &ldquo;speed of light&rdquo; running mode, Sena usually has to be absolutely terrified. Not that THAT will be a problem with the monstrous players that he&rsquo;ll soon find himself running from!  The insanity hits the streets when the feet meet the cleats in EYESHIELD 21! \n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2005,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:43","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 01:49:46","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":15},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":15},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":6},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":2441},{"site":"ANN","externalId":4778},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":966},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1451,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/UhjhmmBv3xWzzssZ8LbVefckisyRoHlxgmbEUEX0.jpg"},{"id":1452,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/uzuTmJIEX9a8HVUdwGtkYKbFwDDiRpjVQUbrtae5.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":51,"name":"Gallop","slug":"gallop"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},